config GNSS_NATIVE_SIM
	bool "native_sim GNSS driver"
	default y
	depends on GNSS
	depends on DT_HAS_ZEPHYR_NATIVE_SIM_GNSS_ENABLED
	depends on BOARD_NATIVE_SIM
	help
	  GNSS receiver for native_sim that reports a position taken from the
	  host: an Android phone's location (through dumpsys, directly or over
	  adb) or a fixed position given on the command line.
